      "sourceText": "下面的 IMU噪声可以先用两句话理解：**测量噪声**管“有多相信这次读数”；**运动状态的过程噪声**管“允许原来的运动估计多快改变”。它们作用不同，不应因为名字都有 `cov` 就一起加大。表中单位按本地公式推导，也不能直接与厂家噪声密度或原始 g读数比较。",
      "translatedText": "The following IMU noise can first be understood in two sentences:**Measurement noise**governs \"how much to trust this reading\";**Process noise of the motion state**governs \"how quickly the original motion estimate is allowed to change\\.\" They serve different roles and should not be increased together just because their names both contain `cov`\\. The units in the table are derived from local formulas and also cannot be directly compared with manufacturer noise density or raw g readings\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 199,
